# Moment of Reckoning: "Choose up to four. You may choose the same mode more than once" (CR 700.2d). Bot1 chooses the destroy mode four
# times, each with a target of its own, and all of Bot2's artifacts are destroyed. A fifth choice is refused: four is the most.

